        {
            "id": "a003_450_0027",
            "en_US": [
                "There are a lot of people in the world,\n",
                "and there are just as many different{VAR BE00}\n",
                "characteristics and ideas.{VAR BE01}\n",
                "I think I'd be really happy if I could\n",
                "meet a lot of people and see the{VAR BE00}\n",
                "differences for myself!"
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "a003_450_0028",
            "en_US": [
                "My mama says there's a scary monster\n",
                "who comes out of the big hole at night,{VAR BE00}\n",
                "so we have to stay home and be good!{VAR BE01}\n",
                "But that monster must be a Pokémon.\n",
                "Right? So I'm not scared at all!"
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "a003_450_0029",
            "en_US": [
                "Along the road ahead, there is a\n",
                "coastline that fishing fans love.{VAR BE01}\n",
                "I'm busy, so I won't fish at night, but\n",
                "there may be big fish!"
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "a003_450_0030",
            "en_US": [
                "My grandma loves to tell old stories,\n",
                "and she makes me listen to her long{VAR BE00}\n",
                "stories all the time.{VAR BE01}\n",
                "Sometimes I just want to go out on my\n",
                "own and paint the town red!"
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "a003_450_0031",
            "en_US": [
                "Ever since I took a post here, I don't\n",
                "really have anything to do.{VAR BE01}\n",
                "I'm so bored! I'm afraid all my policing\n",
                "muscles will shrivel up because I don't{VAR BE00}\n",
                "use them anymore."
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "a003_450_0032",
            "en_US": [
                "My Pokémon always goes out\n",
                "to have fun without me.{VAR BE01}\n",
                "I wonder where it gets that attitude?"
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "a003_450_0033",
            "en_US": "Gahoon! Gahoon!"
        },
        {
            "id": "a003_450_0034",
            "en_US": [
                "My work keeps me very busy, and I only\n",
                "go home once a week or so.{VAR BE01}\n",
                "I'm sorry to leave my wife lonely, but\n",
                "that's the life of a powerful executive.{VAR BE01}\n",
                "Oh, this is a souvenir from a business\n",
                "trip, but she does not seem to need it,{VAR BE00}\n",
                "so I will give it to you.{VAR BE01}"
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "a003_450_0035",
            "en_US": [
                "I leave on a business trip\n",
                "again tomorrow.{VAR BE01}\n",
                "I think of myself as a role model\n",
                "for businesspeople."
            ]
        }
    ]
